<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Kakinada cargoes - Nov 12.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Kakinada cargoes - Nov 12.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Kakinada port on November 12, 1996:</p>
<p>  Commodity		Tons		Ship/Name	 Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD)(Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Fertilisers</p>
<p> Urea		23,509 (ULD)  7,446   Jag Ratna	     23/10</p>
<p> Urea		 6,485 (ULD)  9,247   Faith star	    30/10</p>
<p> Agricultural Pdts	(Nil)</p>
<p> Rice		 4,913 (LDD)  1,087   Shanstburg	    23/08</p>
<p> Rice		 1,765 (LDD)  3,235   Roshni		  09/10</p>
<p> Rice		   295 (LDD)  1,705   Nikolay Dobrolyubov 18/10</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>	    EXP - Expected</p>
<p>There has no work in the port since November 5 due to the cyclonic storm that hit Andhra Pradesh. There were some ship movements on November 12 but port work was held up as workers have not returned.</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Kakinada)</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
